. * wave index -- robust, no macro needed (years map evenly: wave=(year-1990)/2)
. gen wave = (year - 1990)/2

. label var wave "HRS wave (1-16)"

. label var year "Interview year"

. order hhidpn year wave

. 
. ***************************************************************************************
. * B2. Merge in Leave-Behind social-interaction variables (built in hrs_lb.do)
. ***************************************************************************************
. * hrs_lb_long.dta is person-wave (hhidpn + year), already recoded/reverse-coded
. * (W8/2006 onward, rotating half-sample).  Variables are documented in hrs_lb.do.
. merge 1:1 hhidpn year using "- Data/hrs_lb.dta", keep(master match) nogen
(label yesno already defined)

    Result                      Number of obs
    -----------------------------------------
    Not matched                       557,173
        from master                   557,173  
        from using                          0  

    Matched                           166,571  
    -----------------------------------------

. replace inlb = 0 if missing(inlb)        // 0 = not in LB subsample this wave
(557,173 real changes made)

. rename (*_r) (*)

. 
